1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,490
A brave astronaut in a white spacesuit lands on a colorful
alien planet with purple mountains.

2
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:11,869
She meets friendly blue alien creatures with big eyes in a
field of glowing flowers.

3
00:00:11,869 --> 00:00:16,839
The astronaut and aliens work together to build a beautiful
crystal city.
